        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "感恩韩林元的编修，也是一个才貌双全。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 39.135,
      "end": 43.089,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "的。他的夫人朱姨英呢，也是福建田心城的，",
